                                "sense_id": "0a81b5fb-1b18-3775-b3c6-4b9e9703aa4e",
                                "text": "Dein Lebensabend war ein Morgenroth, / Und als des Abends letzte Lichter schwanden, / Da lagen Siegeskränze, hochgeschichtet, / Um Deinen Sarg – das Reich war aufgerichtet.",
                                "translation": "The eventide of your life was a dawning, / And when the evening’s last lights faded, / Victor’s wreaths lay, piled up high, / Around your coffin—the Empire had been erected.",
                                "english": "The eventide of your life was a dawning, / And when the evening’s last lights faded, / Victor’s wreaths lay, piled up high, / Around your coffin—the Empire had been erected."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
